### 变量
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = paste-login-or-switch-token-here
@workflowId = paste-workflow-id-here
@workId = paste-work-id-here
@versionId = paste-work-version-id-here

### 获取作品列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/works
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 保存作品
# 作品归属继承 workflow，前端不要传 spaceId / ownerId / ownerType / visibility。
POST {{baseUrl}}/works
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "测试作品 {{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "REST Client 创建的测试作品",
  "finalImageUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/works/final.png",
  "objectKey": "works/rest-client/final.png",
  "workflowId": "{{workflowId}}",
  "qualityReport": {
    "totalScore": 86,
    "issues": []
  },
  "nodesSnapshot": {},
  "metadata": {
    "canvas": {
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 1024
    }
  }
}

### 获取作品详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 新增作品版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}/versions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "imageUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/works/final-v2.png",
  "objectKey": "works/rest-client/final-v2.png",
  "sourceWorkflowId": "{{workflowId}}",
  "nodesSnapshot": {},
  "qualityReport": {
    "totalScore": 91,
    "issues": []
  }
}

### 获取作品版本列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 获取作品版本详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}/versions/{{versionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 导出作品
POST {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}/export
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "format": "png"
}

### 删除作品
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
